 "id": "c_mi_080",
 "prompt": "In a bright chemistry laboratory, a long lab bench holds rows of test tubes in a glass pipette rack next to beakers filled with colorful solutions. A Bunsen burner flickers beneath a volumetric flask, while a digital scale and a pH meter rest beside a stir plate and a set of graduated cylinders. A microscope stands near a cluster of petri dishes on the counter beneath a fume hood. Safety goggles hang on a rack next to lab coats draped over a lab stool, and a pair of rubber gloves lies beside a sink with a waste bin tucked underneath. On the wall, a periodic table poster hangs beside a safety shower sign, and a centrifuge hums quietly at the end of the bench. A lab notebook lies open beside a pipette. There is no smartphone, no wooden desk, no couch, no painting, and no carpet.",
